<head>
    <meta name="description" content="Dreego demo app with example, SSE, and WebSocket plugins">
</head>

<go>
    title := "Dreego Plugin Showcase"
</go>

<div>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p>This app demonstrates Dreego plugins working together in a real web application.</p>

    <section aria-labelledby="plugins-heading">
        <h2 id="plugins-heading">Active Plugins</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>plugin-example</strong> — greeting endpoint at <code>/example/greet/World</code> and health check at <code>/example/health</code></li>
            <li><strong>plugin-sse</strong> — Server-Sent Events at <code>/sse</code> (broadcasts server time every 2 seconds)</li>
            <li><strong>plugin-websocket</strong> — WebSocket at <code>/ws</code> (echoes messages and broadcasts server time)</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="live-heading">
        <h2 id="live-heading">Live SSE Demo</h2>
        <p>Server time updates via Server-Sent Events:</p>
        <p id="sse-time" aria-live="polite">waiting for events...</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="ws-heading">
        <h2 id="ws-heading">Live WebSocket Demo</h2>
        <p>Open a WebSocket connection and send a message:</p>
        <p>Latest WS message: <span id="ws-msg" aria-live="polite">none yet</span></p>
        <label for="ws-input">Message:</label>
        <input id="ws-input" type="text" value="Hello WebSocket" />
        <button id="ws-send" type="button">Send</button>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="tailwind-heading">
        <h2 id="tailwind-heading">Optional: Tailwind CSS Plugin</h2>
        <p>To add Tailwind CSS to this demo:</p>
        <pre>go get github.com/dreego-stack/plugin-tailwind
sh $(go env GOMODCACHE)/github.com/dreego-stack/plugin-tailwind*/templates/setup.sh
dreego build</pre>
        <p>Then add <code>&lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/tailwind.css"&gt;</code> to the layout head.</p>
    </section>
</div>

<script>
    var es = new EventSource("/sse");
    es.addEventListener("time", function(e) {
        document.getElementById("sse-time").textContent = e.data;
    });
    es.onerror = function() {
        document.getElementById("sse-time").textContent = "connection lost";
    };

    var wsStatus = document.getElementById("ws-msg");
    var wsInput = document.getElementById("ws-input");
    var wsBtn = document.getElementById("ws-send");
    var socket;
    function connect() {
        socket = new WebSocket("ws://" + location.host + "/ws");
        socket.onmessage = function(e) { wsStatus.textContent = e.data; };
        socket.onclose = function() { wsStatus.textContent = "disconnected"; setTimeout(connect, 2000); };
    }
    wsBtn.addEventListener("click", function() {
        if (socket && socket.readyState === 1) {
            socket.send(wsInput.value);
        }
    });
    connect();
</script>